@startuml
title US11 - Register Parameter\nSystem Sequence Diagram (SSD)

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #2563EB
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam ActorBorderColor #334155
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF9E6

actor "Administrator" as Admin
participant "UKLabsMS" as System

Admin -> System : requestParameterRegistration()
System --> Admin : requestParameterDetails()

Admin -> System : submitParameterDetails(code, name,\ndescription, metric, metricType, referenceValues)

activate System

alt Valid information and unique code
    System --> Admin : parameterRegisteredSuccessfully()
else Invalid code format
    System --> Admin : displayValidationError()
else Duplicate parameter code
    System --> Admin : displayDuplicateCodeError()
else Reference values incompatible with metric type
    System --> Admin : displayInvalidReferenceValuesError()
else Other invalid information
    System --> Admin : displayRegistrationError()
end

deactivate System

note right of System
AC11-1:
The code must have exactly
five alphanumeric characters
and must be unique.

AC11-2:
Reference values are only
applicable to numeric metrics.

Metric classification:
Numeric or Qualitative.
end note

@enduml